<title>EGYPT: Egypt says seeks 100,000 tonnes of Argentine wheat.</title>
<headline>Egypt says seeks 100,000 tonnes of Argentine wheat.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1996-10-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Egypt's official commodities buyer said on Saturday he was seeking 100,000 tonnes of Argentine wheat for loading from December 12 to 31.</p>
<p>Samir Shakankiri, vice chairman of the General Authority for Supply Commodities, told Reuters the deadline for the bids was 1100 GMT on November 14.</p>
<p>--Mona Eltahawy, Cairo newsroom +202 578 3290/91</p>
